## Working contract

Operator drives, AI is the horse. Operator approves each artefact before it lands. Iteration: AI drafts → operator reviews → operator approves or revises → AI executes. No bundling. No "while I'm at it" extras.

For specific Claude Code routing of operator intents (`"ingest <url>"`, `"status"`, `/checkin`, etc.), see [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md).

